   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Multiracial group of coworkers in a business meeting in a modern office. A businessman speaks during a meeting and shows graphs on a large screen. His co-workers listen to what he says and use devices during the meeting.</rdf:li>
